          "at": "2026-11-05T12:58:50.860Z",
          "html": "<p>Done: the DNS steps are Squarespace's now, on their own page, <a href=\"/guides/atmosphere/mail-setup.html\" target=\"src-guides-atmosphere-mail-setup-html\">Setting Up Spell's Mail</a> (linked from the atmosphere guide).</p>\n<ul>\n  <li>Squarespace: the domain › DNS › DNS Settings › Custom Records › Add record. Delete any old MX record or email preset first; leave the website's \"Squarespace Defaults\" alone.</li>\n  <li>A table of the nine records each domain needs (Fastmail, Postmark, SPF, DMARC), and Squarespace's one-click Fastmail preset as a shortcut.</li>\n  <li>The other registrars' menus are gone; <code>dig NS</code> stays only as an optional check.</li>\n</ul>"
        }
      ],
